followcar_70.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/8VuNqAqkjS2YE66c8","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_29.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_29.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/fCTXAEUHwnstutEf6","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_30.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_30.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/PUApUGUBLd9AsS9v7","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_31.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_31.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/DJwEq1bajd1D4FSc8","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_32.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_32.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/pNr5pivcUjQDAUuP7","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_33.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_33.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/itCXzgew2KggxSHQ6","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"chile","country_name":"Chile","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_79.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_79.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/rVqdLj2qiS27c5v68","source_page":"/meta/followCars"}],"tips":[{"id":"Kz7l","text":["The Cocos Islands runway can be recognized by it being the widest paved road on the island, with mowed grass on both sides of the runway and this [follow car](https://goo.gl/maps/evWNsAeXZ9ScSxqW9)."],"text_zh":["科科斯群島跑道可以透過它是島上最寬的鋪面道路來識別，跑道兩側皆有修剪過的草皮以及這台[跟拍車](https://goo.gl/maps/evWNsAeXZ9ScSxqW9)。"],"image":"plonkit/cocos-islands/Runway.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/meTENoyBJQZjYXiB8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"cocos islands","country_name":"Cocos Islands"},{"id":"Rg9U","text":["A** yellow follow car** with two front windows can be seen trailing the Google truck on RN 2 east of Palmar Norte and halfway up to Buenos Aires. The **river valley** also makes this section of road unique."],"text_zh":["一輛帶有兩個前車窗的**黃色跟拍車**可以在帕爾馬爾諾特（Palmar Norte）以東的 RN 2 上尾隨 Google 車，一直到通往布宜諾斯艾利斯的中途。**河谷**也讓這段道路變得獨一無二。"],"image":"plonkit/costa-rica/cr_followcar.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/f6V4TLHmAESKuk8Z8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"costa rica","country_name":"Costa Rica"},{"id":"jBWo","text":["A significant portion of the coverage in the West Bank has a visible security **follow car**. The most extensive of these is a small **white Suzuki**, which is found in the central and southern regions."],"text_zh":["約旦河西岸相當一部分的街景覆蓋都有明顯的保鑣**跟拍車**。其中最常見的是一台小型**白色鈴木**（Suzuki），出現在中部和南部地區。"],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcarwhite.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/bdpqi69cm1efcunK8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"z5QI","text":["Another follow car is a small **dark blue Ford**, which is found in the northwest."],"text_zh":["另一台跟拍車是一台小型**深藍色福特**（Ford），出現在西北部。"],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcardarkblue.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/a38qLgKhQomdi26x5","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"vqbJ","text":["This **larger white** Citroën follow car with a **West Bank licence plate** can be found in a region surrounding Jerusalem. It is noticeably found in the cities of Bethlehem and Ramallah.","NOTE: The [side](https://goo.gl/maps/CyZBjDakijcXH87L6) of this car features the text “SECURITY” in a bold font. Furthermore, this coverage will always feature a black Street View car with [no antenna](https://goo.gl/maps/qSquP511uzs7bk9o6)."],"text_zh":["這台帶有**約旦河西岸車牌**的**較大型白色**雪鐵龍（Citroën）跟拍車可以在耶路撒冷周邊地區找到。它特別常見於伯利恆（Bethlehem）和雷姆拉（Ramallah）等城市。","注意：這台車的[側面](https://goo.gl/maps/CyZBjDakijcXH87L6)印有粗體字「SECURITY」。此外，這種拍攝畫質將始終包含一台[沒有天線](https://goo.gl/maps/qSquP511uzs7bk9o6)的黑色 Google 車。"],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcarbigwhite.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/FkHz1cDrgoL7ZUhn8","clues":["license_plates","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"fagW","text":["This **grey Hyundai** follow car is unique to Rahat."],"text_zh":["這輛**灰色現代**跟拍車是拉哈特（Rahat）特有的。"],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/il_rahatfollow.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/dSofA6vuqb3CNgMh6","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"R6l0","text":["The Gobi Gurvan Saikhan National Park, in the far south of Mongolia, features **bright orange sand** and **sand dunes**. There are two separate spots covered in the park: one in the middle just north of Sevrei, which has [distant southern mountains](https://maps.app.goo.gl/jjXtYWfWCBWUuSgs9), and the other in the far southwest corner of the park, which has a [Jeep follow car](https://maps.app.goo.gl/cHgJsPAW8xUFrK8s9)."],"text_zh":["戈壁古爾賽汗國家公園位於蒙古極南部，擁有**明亮的橘色沙子**和**沙丘**。公園內有兩個獨立的街景覆蓋點：一個在色夫雷（Sevrei）正北方的中間地帶，擁有[遙遠的南方山脈](https://maps.app.goo.gl/jjXtYWfWCBWUuSgs9)；另一個在公園的最西南角，配備了[吉普跟拍車](https://maps.app.goo.gl/cHgJsPAW8xUFrK8s9)。"],"image":"plonkit/mongolia/3._gobigurvansaikhan.webp","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/@43.452213,99.895723,3a,133.2y,305.6h,88.94t/data=!3m4!1e1!3m2!1ssC5fADuvY33ktVR-iMUF3g!2e0","clues":["follow_cars","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"mongolia","country_name":"Mongolia"},{"id":"yfEi","text":["A **police car**, most commonly white or black, can almost always be seen following the Street View car. The follow cars may differ slightly from the ones shown in the image."],"text_zh":["幾乎總是可以看到一台**警車**（最常見的是白色或黑色）跟隨在 Google 車後方。跟拍車可能與圖片中顯示的略有不同。"],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/JtDpCOs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/WdpXdwj7TDDRc7GD9","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"pXX3","text":["A flat landscape with coastal vegetation and **many palms** can be seen east of Lekki. The ground is very **sandy**. Almost all of the coverage is old Generation 3, with a [silver follow car](https://www.google.com/maps/@6.4185992,4.079123,3a,15y,284.01h,83.67t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sTrh0nQY2S9hrUGN-v1ejng!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?entry=ttu)."],"text_zh":["雷基（Lekki）以東可以看到帶有海岸植被與**許多棕櫚樹**的平坦景觀。地面非常**沙質**。幾乎所有的覆蓋都是舊的相機世代 3，並配有一台[銀色跟拍車](https://www.google.com/maps/@6.4185992,4.079123,3a,15y,284.01h,83.67t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sTrh0nQY2S9hrUGN-v1ejng!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?entry=ttu)。"],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/jj33SoO.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/1qF5JC2e47m98TbA9","clues":["follow_cars","nature","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"PVr3","text":["This map shows where each **old Generation 3** follow car can be found. They are uncommon, but can still be useful to know.","NOTE: The A121 is not shown on the map as it is recognizable from other clues. This [silver Lexus](https://maps.app.goo.gl/i36WGpXJW9q2fHhh7), not shown on the map, can rarely be seen on the highway between Onitsha and Enugu."],"text_zh":["此地圖顯示了可以找到各個**舊相機世代 3**跟拍車的位置。它們雖然不常見，但了解它們仍然很有用。","備註：地圖上未顯示 A121，因為它可以從其他線索中辨識出來。這台地圖上未顯示的[銀色凌志（Lexus）](https://maps.app.goo.gl/i36WGpXJW9q2fHhh7)，偶爾可以在奧尼查（Onitsha）和埃努古之間的高速公路上看到。"],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/OWnDtAE.webp","link":"","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"1chu","text":["Tunisian licence plates are **black with white text**.","NOTE: Military plates feature a small Tunisian flag on the left side of the plate, which is visible on the dark green follow car."],"text_zh":["突尼西亞車牌是**黑底白字**。","注意：軍用車牌在車牌左側有一個小型突尼西亞國旗，這可以在深綠色的跟拍車上看到。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia_License_Plate.webp","link":"","clues":["license_plates","flags","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"LVo2","text":["One of the best ways to recognize Tunisia is that, in most coverage, the Google car is escorted by a **follow car**.","There are several different follow cars and these are four of the most commonly found ones.","NOTE: Follow cars can be in front of the street view car, or very far behind. Make sure to pan and zoom if you do not find them immediately."],"text_zh":["辨識突尼西亞最好的方法之一是，在大多數街景中，Google 車都有**跟拍車**護衛。","有幾種不同的跟拍車，這是其中最常見的四種。","注意：跟拍車可能在街景車前方，或在非常後方。如果你沒有立即找到牠們，請記得平移和縮放。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/followcars.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/thZSGfK31DS18U4J6","clues":["follow_cars","google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"3nZC","text":["This **light green Toyota** follow car can be found everywhere in the northernmost part of Tunisia. You will never see it south of Hammamet."],"text_zh":["這種**淺綠色 Toyota** 跟拍車在突尼西亞最北部隨處可見。你在哈馬馬特以南絕對看不到它。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-north-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/uX7XBSih82pM4H646","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"jiMW","text":["The **dark green Mazda** is the most common follow car in Tunisia. This becomes apparent if you look at the coverage map, it can be found all the way from Hammamet to Djerba. Aside from the darker colour, it can also be recognized by its military licence plate with a **red strip** on the left."],"text_zh":["**深綠色 Mazda** 是突尼西亞最常見的跟拍車。如果你看街景覆蓋地圖就會發現，它從哈馬馬特一路延伸到傑爾巴島都能找到。除了顏色較深之外，它也可以透過左側帶有**紅色條紋**的軍用車牌來辨識。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-south-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/FxDexhTFBajv1pVo8","clues":["license_plates","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"NNjW","text":["Tunis, the capital of Tunisia, has **a lot of different follow cars**. Most of them can be found all over the city. The light green Toyota can also be spotted here."],"text_zh":["突尼西亞首都突尼斯有**許多不同的跟拍車**。大多數車輛都可以在全市各地找到。淺綠色 Toyota 在這裡也能被發現。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Tunis-follow-cars.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/ypV2X4f88eVjsqRF6","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"deGy","text":["The city of Kairouan in central-northern Tunisia has this unique follow car, a **white Mitsubishi** with white mirrors. The dark green follow car can also sometimes be spotted following the Mitsubishi.","NOTE: Some white follow cars in Tunisia can look similar to the Kairouan car. However, none of them are Mitsubishis."],"text_zh":["位於突尼西亞中北部的凱魯萬市擁有這台獨特的跟拍車，是一輛配備白色後視鏡的**白色 Mitsubishi**。有時也能看到深綠色跟拍車跟在這輛 Mitsubishi 後方。","注意：突尼西亞的一些白色跟拍車看起來可能與凱魯萬的車相似。然而，牠們都不是 Mitsubishi。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Kairouan-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/TYsTYQxbayDt9SU77","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"IOGg","text":["The island of Djerba is the only region of Tunisia where you are usually **not** accompanied by a follow car. Most coverage completely lacks one.","While it is rare, this **white Mercedes** and the dark green follow car can be present."],"text_zh":["傑爾巴島是突尼西亞唯一一個通常**沒有**跟拍車陪同的地區。大多數街景覆蓋完全沒有跟拍車。","雖然少見，但這輛**白色賓士**和深綠色跟拍車還是可能會出現。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Djerba_Car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/fY8AruYDYGHQA9FM8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"DECo","text":["The island of Djerba can sometimes have a distinct vibe. There tend to be a lot of palm trees. Whitewashed, traditional buildings with blue doors and windows are common.","NOTE: Not all locations on the island will have this distinct vibe. A lack of a follow car is another good way to confirm that you are on Djerba."],"text_zh":["傑爾巴島有時會給人一種獨特的氛圍。這裡往往有許多棕櫚樹。塗白、帶有藍色門窗的傳統建築很常見。","注意：島上並非所有地點都有這種獨特的氛圍。沒有跟拍車是確認你身處傑爾巴島的另一種好方法。"],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Djerba-vibe.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/niGniYJgMVZBb4U19","clues":["follow_cars","architecture","nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"}],"gallery_count":51,"tip_count":18,"intro":{"lead":"固定跟在街景車後面的車，是特定拍攝批次的標記","body":["某些國家的拍攝作業會有一台車長時間跟在街景車後方，車型與顏色固定。認出跟拍車等於認出那批拍攝，可以直接鎖定國家。","往後看畫面底部，如果同一台車連續出現在多個場景，那就是跟拍車而不是巧合。"]}}